### ============================================================
### Notes App — API Testing (VS Code REST Client)
### ============================================================

@base = http://localhost:3000/api


### ── FOLDERS ────────────────────────────────────────────────

### GET semua folder
GET {{base}}/folders
Content-Type: application/json

###

### POST buat folder baru
POST {{base}}/folders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nama": "Kuliah"
}

###

### PUT edit folder (ganti 1 dengan id folder)
PUT {{base}}/folders/3
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nama": "Kuliah 2025"
}

###

### DELETE folder (ganti 1 dengan id folder)
DELETE {{base}}/folders/3
Content-Type: application/json


### ── NOTES ───────────────────────────────────────────────────

### GET semua notes
GET {{base}}/notes
Content-Type: application/json

###

### GET notes by folder
GET {{base}}/notes?folder_id=4
Content-Type: application/json

###

### GET notes dengan search
GET {{base}}/notes?search=algoritma
Content-Type: application/json

###

### GET satu note (ganti 1 dengan id note)
GET {{base}}/notes/1
Content-Type: application/json

###

### POST buat note baru
POST {{base}}/notes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "judul": "Catatan Baru",
  "isi": "Isi catatan di sini...",
  "folder_id": 5
}

###

### POST buat note tanpa folder
POST {{base}}/notes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "judul": "Catatan Tanpa Folder",
  "isi": "Ini catatan yang tidak masuk folder manapun."
}

###

### PUT edit note (ganti 1 dengan id note)
PUT {{base}}/notes/12
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "judul": "Catatan Diupdate",
  "isi": "Isi yang sudah diedit.",
  "folder_id": null
}

###

### DELETE note (ganti 1 dengan id note)
DELETE {{base}}/notes/12
Content-Type: application/json
